corsair-lncore-dkms for Debian
-----------------------------

This package provides a DKMS kernel module for controlling Corsair Lighting Node Core devices.

After installation, plug in the device to create /dev/corsair-lncore0. Use the device file to control RGB lighting.

For Secure Boot, sign the module if needed.

